    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Intervals</span><span class=\"chip accent\">One-pass sweep</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/insert-interval/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 57</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Insert Interval</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The list is already sorted and disjoint, so it splits into three runs around the new interval: left of it (copy), overlapping it (absorb into one block), right of it (copy). One pass, no sort. O(n) time, O(n) output.</p>\n"
